<div>
    <page id="asset-gallery" title="Files, Includes, and Zip Archives"
          publish_at="{{ UNIT_2_DUE }}, {{ YEAR }}, 8:00 AM">
        # Asset gallery

        A time-bounded file in a Canvas folder:

        <file path="assets/reference.txt" canvas_folder="Demo Course/References"
              unlock_at="{{ COURSE_START }}, {{ YEAR }}, 8:00 AM"
              lock_at="{{ COURSE_END }}, {{ YEAR }}, 11:59 PM"/>

        A generated archive uses a priority overlay, an additional file, and a regex exclusion:

        <zip path="assets/base" priority_path="assets/priority"
             additional_files="assets/LICENSE.txt" exclude=".*\\.tmp$"
             name="starter-kit.zip" canvas_folder="Demo Course/Archives"
             unlock_at="{{ COURSE_START }}, {{ YEAR }}, 8:00 AM"
             lock_at="{{ COURSE_END }}, {{ YEAR }}, 11:59 PM"/>

        This internal file link resolves independently of the generated download link:
        <course-link type="file" id="reference.txt">open the reference file</course-link>.
    </page>

    <page id="diagram-gallery" title="Mermaid Diagram Gallery">
        # Mermaid diagrams

        A fenced diagram:

        ```mermaid {: alt="Three-step deployment flow" name="deployment-flow" class="diagram"}
        flowchart LR
            Source --> DryRun[Dry run] --> Sandbox
        ```

        An inline tag:

        <mermaid name="decision-flow.png" alt="Decision flow for a release test" class="diagram" theme="forest">
            flowchart TD
                A[Dry run clean?] -->|Yes| B[Deploy to sandbox]
                A -->|No| C[Fix source]
                C --> A
        </mermaid>

        A diagram loaded from a file:

        <mermaid path="diagrams/resource-graph.mmd" canvas_folder="Demo Course/Diagrams"
                 unlock_at="{{ COURSE_START }}, {{ YEAR }}, 8:00 AM"
                 lock_at="{{ COURSE_END }}, {{ YEAR }}, 11:59 PM"
                 alt="MDXCanvas resource graph" class="diagram"/>
    </page>

    <page id="slides-gallery" title="Quarto Slides Gallery">
        # Quarto slides

        <quarto-slides path="slides/release-smoke-test.qmd"
                       name="release-smoke-test.html"
                       canvas_folder="Demo Course/Slides"
                       unlock_at="{{ COURSE_START }}, {{ YEAR }}, 8:00 AM"
                       lock_at="{{ COURSE_END }}, {{ YEAR }}, 11:59 PM"/>
    </page>

    <include path="questions.canvas.md.xml.jinja" usediv="false"/>
</div>
